        "created_at": "2015-10-31T06:21:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is a fairly irregular contest held by the scifi/fantasy book review website <a href=\"http://fantasyliterature.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">fantasyliterature.com</a>.&nbsp; The basic premise is that there are some books with really ugly/horrifying/bizarre covers, and we need to come up with titles for books that would actually match the cover.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The game is fun, so I thought I'd share it with all of you!&nbsp; Here is the <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/thoughtful-thursday-rename-this-horrible-cover-7/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">ongoing competition (mildly NSFW)</a>.&nbsp; I've tried to come up with a name for this one, but I can't beat some of the ones already suggested.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>But we don't have to stop at the current cover!&nbsp; Here are the other seventeen* covers to rename:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/this-cover-needs-a-better-title/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">1</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/rtb-bonehunters/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">2</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/is-that-supposed-to-be-a-lion/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">3</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/rename-that-cover-sexy-babes-and-killer-whales/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">4</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/thoughtful-thursday-cover-rename/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">5</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/rename-that-cover-psycho-floating-baby-head-edition/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">6</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/thoughtful-thursday-rename-this-horrible-cover/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">7</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/thoughtful-thursday-rename-this-horrible-cover-2/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">8</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/thoughtful-thursday-rename-this-horrible-cover-3/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">9</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/thoughtful-thursday-rename-this-horrible-cover-4/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">10</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/thoughtful-thursday-rename-this-horrible-cover-5/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">11</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/thoughtful-thursday-rename-this-horrible-cover-6/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">12</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/thoughtful-thursday-rename-that-cover/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">13</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/rename-that-cover-mad-libs-edition/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">14</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/thoughtful-thursday-rename-that-cover-the-spirit-lens/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">15</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/rename-that-cover-is-that-an-ominous-tower-staring-at-my-cleavage/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">16</a> <a href=\"http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/rename-that-cover-leather-pants-and-self-decapitation-a-mariners-story/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">17</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Some are worse than others.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Now start renaming away!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also, it's worth noting that <a href=\"http://FantasyLiterature.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">FantasyLiterature.com</a> has a giveaway like this (not always rename-this-cover, though) every Thursday.&nbsp; So if you are interested in any of the books in their stacks, then I definitely recommend visiting frequently.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>*When I started gathering them, I'd forgotten that there were so many.&nbsp; Please do not feel obliged to name all of them.</p>",
